{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25861","headline":"州中小饮便别牛相 · 李绅","name":"州中小饮便别牛相","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"笙歌罢曲辞宾侣，庭竹移阴就小斋。\n愁不解颜徒满酌，病非伤肺爲忧怀。\n耻矜学步贻身患，岂慕醒狂蹑祸阶。\n从此别离长酩酊，洛阳狂狷任椎埋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25861.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25861","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}